{title: Din Dhal Jaaye}
{artist: Guide 1965 Mohammed Rafi S D Burman}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] [C],        Din dhal jaaye, haye raat na jaaye
[G] [C],        tu to na aaye teri yaad sataye
[D] [G],        Pyar mein jinke
[D] [G],        sab jag chhoda
[D] [C],        aur hue badnaam
[D] [G],        unke hi haato
[D] [G],        haal hua yeh
[D] [C] [G],        baithe hai dil ko thaam
[G] [C],        apne kabhi the, ab hai paraye
[D] [G],        aisi hi rimzim,
[D] [G],        aise buhare
[D] [C],        aisi hi thi barsaat
[D] [G],        khud se judaa aur
[D] [G],        jag se paraye
[D] [C],        hum dono hai saath
[G] [C],        phir se woh saawan ab kyon na aaye
[D] [G],        dil ke mere
[D] [G],        paas ho itne
[D] [C],        phir bhi ho kitni door
[D] [G],        tum mujhse mein
[D] [G],        dil se pareshaan
[D] [C],        dono hai majboor
[G] [C],        aise me kisko kaun manaye
